{
  "module": "kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "e0a8cb76f007d0f775fa2eb031cc45e6",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "d5aeb100092ae0a2682fa7903eb532d3c5dd7a16b3d2ab813eb50e62e272684b",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "中央トレセンにとって、それは聞き慣れない名前だった。しかし %YOU% はこの一年、この名前を忘れたことは一度もなかった。いや、より正確に言えば……この競走%UMA%の成績を。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "089a251d2019b1dfca323fd4c0899725",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "1fc3f861ac9ec1325638a63b3ae1b6cad2de636b708e6b68b05b2f2015c64d55",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "十二戦十勝、二度の敗北はいずれも僅差のハナ差……%YOU% はオフィスの机の前に座り、%YOU% が何度も何度も開いてきたその資料をめくった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "fb4a299075524c946f213a733aa1a8d7",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "f75decc7c7ba1d02850637f0b27543f473f6d3daf45b71b951d9fae9e59108c5",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "あの競走%UMA%は去年から地方シリーズ戦で頭角を現してきた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6fdb8c1a76cdbb251e0b292935482e25",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "945658f1bc9a68c055a74d0593884a618c398c52fb3d1d5df3397a8d02c96fdc",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "地方シリーズ戦は中央シリーズ戦のように政府が公式に主催するものではなく、地方競馬区連合が自主的に開催するものであり、中央のトレーナーである %YOU% の目から見れば、その競技レベルはまだまだ中央には及ばない。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "342d492a1da0556d5cf486fb53df0c96",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        8
      ],
      "originalHash": "4ee0129c86772c5bea77a3aa4beef2a042d413fe7eb8ae2cdffe78aa8bf16180",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "%YOU% は子どもの頃、テレビで見た伝説の競走%UMA% ヘイセイク の勇姿を決して忘れることができなかった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "d82b50a967f9a5fd516b8ba2c75c6095",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        9
      ],
      "originalHash": "ee5ae13cc6a8d70f23593c400f5d1cb7b7f32fe31bf169beefd394e975143a4b",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "あの競走%UMA%はオグリキャップと同じく地方シリーズ戦の出身でありながら、数々の壁を乗り越えて中央の舞台の頂点へと駆け上がり、その力だけで当時低迷していた競走%UMA%競技に再び熱狂の波を巻き起こした。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "52a56854e4e81e32395d5f5a10a9ce9c",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        11
      ],
      "originalHash": "2348d704bd405acf0a01d0aca6034682b2251f08667e522e2df301bc182752ac",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "今のところヘイセイクの域に達した競走%UMA%はまだ一頭もいないが、地方シリーズ戦のレベルが静かに上がってきていることもまた紛れもない事実で……",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "08ef0181047a4caba58b1de44e027a81",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        13
      ],
      "originalHash": "8234741eec05fdac3b5322b3a94354a1737ef9914162028d0d4ad2539c3631c8",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "%YOU% の視線は傍らに置かれた古い新聞へと移った。そこにはオグリキャップが初めて勝利した後のウイナーズサークルで——民謡を踊る写真が印刷されていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "3807bce7e60220cabde8fcacf62ef2da",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        15
      ],
      "originalHash": "e6b2d5c2096e75c26f92727a9612ce1e62d58c68265a6d6ec6b2d95a24562a78",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "数ヶ月後の中京カップで%SEX%が大活躍してから注目し始めた他のトレーナーたちとは違い、%YOU% はとるに足らない地方レースの頃からオグリキャップに興味を持っていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "9c49f56ab4eded89df7f71e463e88d37",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        16
      ],
      "originalHash": "f166f3d122c63ac304eafd97778eccd09f35813819e27117b4c12a71e8a7b51a",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "そして今週、%SEX%が中央トレセンにやってくる。そのとき %YOU% は%SEX%の新たなトレーナーとなる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6871ba924c83af44e43fc79cd7b7a8ca",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        17
      ],
      "originalHash": "1dc68bd6daae06a8ef84b0eacbbfdec16f8dc30f45bbc17b2d61a9da904004c1",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "怪物が中央トレセンに乗り込んでくる日がやってきた。%YOU% は緊張を胸に秘めながら、校門の前でオグリキャップを待ち構えた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8f38fc494495ff6bb51667d2d8d29246",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        18
      ],
      "originalHash": "9e782c679d283ddc516633bbe35fd59c8e53af19750f6a43614430422272b858",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "理事長秘書 %T_NAME% が %YOU% の傍らに付き添い、時間つぶしに %YOU% と他愛のない会話を交わしていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "ca994e4dca6a1962471269d0c8bd18d1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        20,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "4b7b31c76271e21db12b77b1e45e92b4df973d82bf0349d8163ae9545ac1ba42",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "「%YOURNAME% さん、あなたの責任はこれから非常に大きなものになりますよ……もちろん、他の%UMA%を担当することの責任が軽いと言っているわけではありませんが。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "5c60dbeda9d3607ad6758bc3349cb15f",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        21,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "4c80242a79dce86003240fd0b988903be0b5a50b7593f9a45a1ef673dccf7330",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "「ただ、オグリキャップのような%UMA%は……本当に滅多に現れない逸材ですね。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e3ed7c510c3e9913c6a8216bd0867256",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        23,
        "lines",
        0,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "7d84d1a5d57af85bdd010bcf4a3569e2dca7ded4efc95fbc316bb15df53dc1eb",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "「もっとも、オグリキャップさんのような競走%UMA%は、%SEX%はそんなことなど全く気にしないでしょうけれど。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "b5e9c071ef80f7e2e76a88aef298d2ea",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        23,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "5be3967f86ab370f355e350ac746d45e57f7d93b876c5d6284d4528e249d150f",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "%T_NAME% はそう言って意味深な微笑みを浮かべた。%YOU% は%SEX%がここまでオグリキャップに注目していたとは思っていなかった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4c3979733fd909239e319a1e063407f1",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        23,
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "8b6d4e199d34feb8a65b6556e711114cde7e557541f0bce46bf05ab25fdbcbaf",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "%SEX%の言う通り、オグリキャップは稀有な禁欲系競走%UMA%だ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f793c20851c25c109127dadd8fd7b4a6",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        23,
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "e4ed33489f55b594c8f969ac92dca9cf7164d341672702dc53b5c6155efbe360",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "この禁欲とは七情六欲のことではなく、%SEX%のレースへの追求が非常に純粋で澄んでいるという意味だ。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "8df20b98722ceae8eabe88bed24e3f97",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        23,
        "lines",
        4
      ],
      "originalHash": "c58b8fa26c7b8055ed174376bf65da5782b0b0a62e35c2316393ece8077f11b7",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "多くの競走%UMA%とは違い、オグリキャップは名声や利益のために走るのではなく、ただ純粋に走ることへの愛と競争心を胸に抱いてレースへと臨んでいる。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae2d8f31f41df2adce37491abcdd9b7",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        24,
        "content"
      ],
      "originalHash": "137b6717ecca22eececf4d9b8c0903409aa0f75950dc7f80f9b23edc28bebeec",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "「逸材ですか……あなたと比べてどうなんでしょう？」（%T_NAME% 好感-20、恋慕+2）",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "4b427f14690d105d92668284f322dc70",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        24,
        "lines",
        0,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "2811a4c89a73e9e5f2dbd398bd139aa9a22da750647335735537df2e5d25b2ea",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "「冗談はおやめください、私はただの理事長秘書ですよ。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "f2e128c5511a42746a5bafcdfc5b6acb",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        24,
        "lines",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "53da95be19ed13aaf7ac08d2186e7a604eafc98bc53f6ced15e161c820c0c4d6",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "%T_NAME% はそう言って意味深な微笑みを浮かべたが、%YOU% は%SEX%のその微笑みの裏に隠された殺気を確かに感じ取っていた。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e56b4b032290da9d4c683c2c8686ed72",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        24,
        "lines",
        2
      ],
      "originalHash": "d7a475e1548d2b87efb9539ffdacb9879eae40006229852fcc3f4c034fb4b511",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "%YOU% はこの冗談を%SEX%が本気で怒るとは思っていなかった。なぜなら%SEX%のその小さな秘密は、永遠に %YOU% の胸の中にしまわれるのだから。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "78bd97fc30779af0f2d729ca3e597341",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        24,
        "lines",
        3
      ],
      "originalHash": "47f2869ca8a441f0b37cfa0eeb3659503e7a91433af42ee850f6125c2b06f6ce",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "%T_NAME% は %YOU% が%SEX%を売ることはないとわかっており、%YOU% も%SEX%が %YOU% は%SEX%を売らないとわかっているとわかっている。それがふたりの暗黙の了解だった。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "59d10ba22058cf3de4e0dbc7e6f836d2",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        27
      ],
      "originalHash": "0c153e951aa7818cecc42a5abe229ce2a976e4822fbccca74b50c13728aa688f",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "ふたりは小走りで出迎えに向かい、%T_NAME% が先に申し分のない端正な所作でオグリキャップに挨拶をした。",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "e81ce34f273f45d0053abeb364931428",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
      "yamlPath": [
        "rec",
        28,
        "content",
        1
      ],
      "originalHash": "7290c8577d7417f9bf81eb5bf2147dc111e0776c32ea63d0919ea9cb27d4c4a7",
      "sourceFileHash": "c4bc97740381e8228d0988b2cdce29a11f6c6f256ce98191aedace29437fe5ca",
      "originalText": "「『日本競走%UMA%トレーニングセンター学園』へようこそ。理事長秘書の——ハルウララと申します。」",
      "koreanText": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "970abdf04aed96fa85a33ea3a87b4482",
      "sourcePath": "sources/erauma/ere/i18n/ko-KR/kojo/100600-Oguri-Cap/rec-6.kojo",
      "key": "rec",
      "line": null,
      "kind": "kojo",
